Subject: Route deletions to submit-suggestion

Why: asked to delete a namespace, the agent wrote a Namespace manifest with an invented `state: deleted` annotation (#3077). Merging it would declare the namespace, not delete it. The description routes deletions to submit-suggestion, whose deletion section answers it, and section 8 says a manifest cannot ask for a delete.
Local-Issue: #3077
Upstream-Issue: none
Retire-When: never; submit-suggestion is this repository's skill

